# The state the page is built from is never committed.
#
# A committed snapshot is a number nobody checked. The first deployment of the page about
# `ai-sdlc-os` published last month's test count for exactly this reason — the file was
# there to be used, every step of the build reported success, and the page was a month
# stale with nothing red anywhere to say so.
#
# `npm run collect` writes it. The build copies it next to the page. Nothing tracks it.
src/state/

# A checkout the collector made, and the environment the project's own suite needs.
build/
node_modules/
dist/
.astro/

# Python's, because the collectors import the project and run its suite.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/

.DS_Store
